WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.650
<i>I'm Nana Mishima.</i>

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:06.590
<i>Enoshima Soccer Club has 
finally started to move</i>

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:08.390
<i>into the Inter-High competitions.</i>

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:10.350
<i>The training camp...</i>

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:14.570
<i>Well, all kinds of things happened...</i>

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:18.020
<i>But in any case, everyone got 
through it and is ready to go.</i>

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.580
<i>All that's left is to 
keep practicing everyday</i>

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.440
<i>and wait for the first tournament match.</i>

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:28.510
<i>As for myself, I had my debut 
as a player for Nadeshiko Japan.</i>

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:30.380
<i>I worried about various things,</i>

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.410
<i>but I was finally able 
to take my first steps,</i>

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:38.850
<i>and, while playing, I realized 
that I really do like soccer.</i>

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:43.130
<i>However, I couldn't tell 
Kakeru and the others,</i>

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:45.340
<i>so I still continue my busy schedule</i>

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.400
<i>as both a player and a 
manager for the soccer club.</i>

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:24.930
<b>Little Witch</b>

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.210
All right. We'll be 
playing football today.

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:36.230
Break up into male and female teams of 5!

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:37.580
Okay!

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:37.580
Okay!

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:39.490
Um...

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:41.010
We need another player.

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:43.260
We have an extra player.

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:49.170
Sorry, girls,

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.940
but would one of you go 
over to the boys' team?

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.300
A girl?!

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:55.600
What're we going to do?

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.000
We don't have enough people.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.020
I guess we don't have a choice.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.730
Ew! Gross!

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:04.930
I'll just watch.

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:06.600
No way.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:07.620
Hey, Nana.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.250
Huh?

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.200
Yes. I'll play for the boys' team.

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:12.320
What?

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.540
But... Nana!

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:28.600
Let's go, Kakeru.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:31.230
Y-Yeah...

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.180
She's my type, my type, my type!

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.530
I want to study her!

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:50.790
I'm going to eat you... alive?

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:52.660
Thanks for the... meal?

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:55.490
Wh-What?

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.480
Even I can't beat her.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:03:59.960
There's no way you could stop her.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:03.970
Killer...

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.640
Sexual harassment attack!

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.470
What do we do?

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:18.150
I won't let your death have been in vain!

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:22.230
No way! Nana! What?

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.110
Breaking news!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.880
Seven, you've gotten better again!

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:32.310
Go! Enoshima Tower!

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:34.250
T-Tower.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.090
Kakeru.

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:39.800
As if I'd let you!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.720
Th-Through my legs?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.630
For gym!

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.430
Nana!

00:04:58.430 --> 00:04:59.770
You're too amazing!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.360
Your teacher is impressed.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:03.600
Nana-chan!

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:04.320
All right!

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:05.640
Nice shot.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:11.980
Nana!

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:07.330
Yeah!

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:14.450
Not bad, Nana-chan.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.440
You, on the other hand.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:26.830
To be looking elsewhere 
during my class...

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:28.380
Oh, man.

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:29.180
Fool.

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:31.000
Pay attention!

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.270
Kakeru!

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:51.710
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:55.120
It's totally fine.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.760
Do you want to rest for a second, Seven?

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:59.130
I'm fine.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.340
Let's go!

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:01.530
Okay.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:07.270
You were amazing in gym today.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:08.470
Thanks.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.790
Practicing in the park can 
only do so much, right?

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.000
You've got to play on the field.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.810
Th-That's true.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:23.190
You've figured out your weakness,

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:25.030
but you still keep losing the ball.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.680
It's not so easy.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.190
Keep making excuses like that

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.640
and you'll never take on the world.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.370
It's too soon to take on the world.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.660
It isn't!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:39.040
Suguru-san was taking it on 
when he was 10 years old.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:47.970
Someday, even I...

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.770
Someday, even I...

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:51.890
will do the same!

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.580
Ow.

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:13.970
S-Sorry.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:36.840
S-Seven?

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:40.380
Do you remember our 
promise with Suguru-san?

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.150
Someday we'll wear Japan's uniform.

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.560
Sorry, I've got to get up early tomorrow.

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:04.370
See you.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:12.470
What?!

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.430
Th-This is...

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:19.490
Nadeshiko Japan's savior,

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:22.390
The Little Witch, is a high school idol?

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:25.100
What a surprise, right?

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:29.480
This, too.

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.410
Nana Mishima, The Little Witch.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:39.270
It's the title of a newspaper article 
about Mishima-san's success.

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:42.960
I knew she wasn't just 
anybody, but still...

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.690
I couldn't believe it at first.

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:49.380
But why didn't she tell us?

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:51.900
Kakeru, you knew, didn't you?

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:52.970
You should've told us.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.590
This afternoon is the practice 
match against SF Frankfurt.

00:08:58.590 --> 00:09:00.340
Let's go watch it!

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:05.190
Good morning.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:08.720
Coach, Aizawa and the 
others haven't arrived.

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:11.390
I thought I just saw them...

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:13.440
Seriously? Skipping practice?

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.070
Those guys...

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:19.900
No, no. I've assigned them 
a separate menu for today.

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:21.120
Separate menu?

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:32.250
<i>Seven, why didn't you tell me?</i>

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.960
Do you remember our 
promise with Suguru-san?

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:49.640
<i>I have to say, I'm frustrated... and angry.</i>

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.530
<i>But even more than that,</i>

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.990
<i>I feel an indescribable sadness
 welling up inside me.</i>

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:02.840
The kickoff is only moments away.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:06.140
This is the practice match 
between Nadeshiko Japan

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:07.860
and the German women's Bundesliga team,

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:11.670
last year's champions, SF Frankfurt!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.730
You'll want to keep an eye 
out for the player who,

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.040
in the Miami Hurricane match,

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:19.550
suddenly debuted with 
2 goals and 1 assist:

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.220
Nana Mishima!

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:28.790
This morning's sports page picture 
of her was just beautiful.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:30.920
She's apparently got looks, too,

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.200
but what we really care about 
is her ability as a player.

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.900
It's fine! She's beautiful!

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:37.990
However...

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:39.450
looking at her history,

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:42.280
Mishima hasn't played for 
any team for over a year.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:44.690
She can do it!

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:47.530
No matter what you say, she's beautiful!

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:50.390
I'm starting to get nervous.

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:53.540
To think that Nana-chan 
was the "little bitch"...

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:54.820
It's "little witch"!

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:59.590
Could she be better at soccer than me?

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:02.670
That was never even a question.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:05.990
Hey, you know...

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:07.230
Seven...

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.470
Wh-What?

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:16.030
What an amazing response 
for SF Frankfurt.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.750
Mina!

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:18.990
Mina-chan!

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.350
She's so cool!

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:23.450
Mina-chan! You're beautiful!

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:25.470
Who's Mina?

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:29.050
Mina Meier. Germany's ace.

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:31.420
Apparently, she's a celebrity in Europe.

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:33.050
You seem to know a lot.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:35.170
Yeah, I did some research.

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:37.380
She's done some modeling, too.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:42.520
I just remembered!

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:43.990
I have her photo book!

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:44.710
What?

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:45.840
You know her?

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:48.940
So she plays soccer...

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.260
Did she say something?

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:22.720
She seems to know who I am.

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:23.880
What'd she say?

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:28.100
Said she can see where the "little" 
in "little witch" comes from.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:31.360
She sure said it.

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:32.860
It's fine, Ishiki-san.

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:37.560
Next, I'll show her what 
the "witch" means, too.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:41.680
Let's go.

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:42.350
Yes.

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:52.210
Now, this noteworthy 
match is kicking off!

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:16.940
This is the practice match between 
Nadeshiko Japan and SF Frankfurt.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:19.070
The ball goes to Nana Mishima.

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:26.860
Mishima takes the ball in with a dribble.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:31.660
But Mina Meier has marked her.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:35.560
Check out the height difference.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:37.540
There must be 20 centimeters 
between them.

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:40.970
If it's Mishima-san...

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.840
Mina isn't just a big player.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:49.090
Her quick plays, where 
the balls seems to fly,

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.080
got her the nickname

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.950
The Dancing Dove of the Field.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:00.770
Shoot!

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:04.820
Oh! Mishima loses the ball!

00:14:10.770 --> 00:14:11.950
Seven...

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.120
She's fast!

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.080
Mina's amazing!

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.730
Mina! Mina! Mina!

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.590
Mina Meier, with her long strides, 
takes off with a dribble

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.930
and cuts through Japan's defense!

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:32.510
A middle shot!

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:36.520
Goal!

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:41.310
Mina Meier's middle 
takes a goal from Japan.

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:43.810
Amazing...

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.150
The first goal in no time.

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:55.200
There was nothing Nadeshiko 
Japan could've done.

00:14:56.320 --> 00:14:57.560
Could representing Japan

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:00.040
be too much pressure for Mishima-san?

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:11.340
<i>Seven!</i>

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:15.680
Now, Nadeshiko Japan is trying 
to regain control of the game.

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.530
<i>Full of holes.</i>

00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:22.810
She's fast! She's fast!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:26.000
Mina Meier cuts into the area once again

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:29.320
and here's another middle shot.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.500
The keeper blocks it!

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:32.750
It's out...

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:35.700
but the loose ball goes to Mina again!

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:37.410
Watch out!

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:41.500
As if being sucked in, the ball 
gravitates towards the goal...

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:43.880
Clear!

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.380
It's clear!

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:47.780
Ishiki gets to the ball just in time.

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.340
Just what you'd expect 
from Japan's ace, Ishiki.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.860
That was a remarkable judgment.

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:51.800
Tae-san.

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.170
That was close...

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:57.610
It's starting to look like a 
one-sided match, but...

00:15:57.610 --> 00:15:58.670
This is where it starts.

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:02.600
Mishima won't let it end like this.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.040
Because no matter what you say,

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:08.580
she's beautiful!

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:12.720
Tae-san!

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:13.410
All right.

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:19.120
Turn this atmosphere around.

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:24.540
Nana! Nana! Nana!

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:29.440
You wanna be my prey again, Miss Little?

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.540
Thank you, Mina.

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:34.470
You reminded me of something.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.010
H-Here it comes!

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.180
<i>Roulette?</i>

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:45.290
<i>Too easy!</i>

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:49.620
<i>What?</i>

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:51.030
There it is!

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:58.140
Goal!

00:16:58.320 --> 00:16:59.330
Tie game!

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.250
Takeda-san, that play just now...

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:07.650
That is her signature play, 
the super feint: Witchy Turn.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.500
Kakeru-kun, that just now...

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:12.910
What was that?

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:13.590
Yeah,

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:17.780
it looks like a regular roulette,
 but as you're waiting for the turn,

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:20.060
it comes back around the other way.

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:24.770
A feint that's only possible 
with a girl's lighter build.

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:27.230
I see...

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:30.610
No wonder you're the Little Witch.

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:35.010
It's gonna be fun.

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:46.370
<i>It was a spectacular match.</i>

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:51.990
<i>Both teams never gave up an inch.</i>

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:53.940
<i>They pushed forward and then defended.</i>

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:55.860
<i>Each white hot development in the game</i>

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:58.890
<i>had every person in the 
audience electrified</i>

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.850
<i>and the excitement just kept growing.</i>

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:11.370
<i>The final score was 5-5, a draw.</i>

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:13.180
<i>An outstanding game beyond 
what you'd expect</i>

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:14.440
<i>from an exhibition match.</i>

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:16.650
<i>What's more,</i>

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:18.910
<i>in this match, Seven became</i>

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:22.700
<i>Japan's top female player.</i>

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:27.040
Still a far cry from major league 
soccer, but quite a few amazing

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:30.250
female soccer players like Mishima and 
Mina have been appearing recently.

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:34.860
Yes, the era of women's 
soccer is soon upon us.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.370
I guarantee it.

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.780
With this much talent on the table,

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.940
cultivating and growing,

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:43.300
it could even be called the golden age.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.650
S-Sure...

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.170
Could you look this way, please?

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:49.090
Please!

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:54.580
The next time might be World Cup.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:00.980
Just one thing...

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:02.320
What?

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.040
The blue shirt

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:08.290
suits you very well.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:15.840
Thanks, Mina.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.350
See you.

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:27.770
Not feeling lost anymore?

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:34.130
I look forward to playing with you again.

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:38.500
Same to you.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:20.890
What am I doing?

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.390
Mishima-san, maybe you 
should wear a jersey.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:48.490
She looked this way!

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:49.870
Photo op!

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.360
Nana-sama!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.630
Nana-chan!

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:54.600
That's good, too!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.140
Hey!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:58.370
Some scary guy showed up!

00:20:58.370 --> 00:20:59.610
Let's get out of here.

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:02.490
Seriously...

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:22.150
<i>Seven...</i>

00:22:12.670 --> 00:22:14.510
Why did you keep it a secret?

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:19.640
I was surprised. Really.

00:22:20.720 --> 00:22:22.000
I'm sorry.

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:26.760
I wanted to tell you properly, 
after things settled down.

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:38.190
In America, women's soccer is popular.

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:41.720
There's college soccer, and a pro league.

00:22:42.510 --> 00:22:45.340
I was supported by so many teammates

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:47.390
and I played my best.

00:22:48.810 --> 00:22:51.980
Eventually I earned recognition,

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:55.290
but this time the expectation 
became stressful.

00:22:55.980 --> 00:22:59.870
On top of that, adults started 
getting all excited on their own.

00:23:02.470 --> 00:23:05.180
Life off the field became so hectic,

00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:07.680
I couldn't concentrate on my game.

00:23:08.290 --> 00:23:10.660
Soccer stopped being fun.

00:23:11.880 --> 00:23:14.640
Right about then,

00:23:14.640 --> 00:23:16.940
my parents were transferred 
back to Japan for work,

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:20.210
and I ran away from 
my team and came, too.

00:23:22.240 --> 00:23:24.900
I know how you feel.

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:28.920
When I was approached by Nadeshiko Japan,

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:30.430
I was lost.

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:33.140
I wanted to play soccer.

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:37.880
But I was worried that it would 
turn out like it did in America.

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:41.050
So, I...

00:23:42.510 --> 00:23:43.850
That's enough.

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:49.590
It's okay.

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:51.820
It's really okay.

00:23:59.780 --> 00:24:00.970
Hey, Kakeru,

00:24:00.970 --> 00:24:03.820
I'm going to continue as 
the manager for the club.

00:24:05.270 --> 00:24:08.260
And our night practices, too.

00:24:11.940 --> 00:24:12.940
That's okay, right?

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:15.660
Of course.

00:24:18.910 --> 00:24:22.520
<i>I might not have the kind of genius</i>

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:23.900
<i>that my brother or you have,</i>

00:24:25.390 --> 00:24:28.230
<i>but there's no use in rushing things.</i>

00:24:29.630 --> 00:24:31.780
<i>In my own way, one step at a time,</i>

00:24:32.100 --> 00:24:35.420
<i>I'll keep climbing that staircase.</i>

00:24:37.670 --> 00:24:39.990
<i>It might take time,</i>

00:24:40.880 --> 00:24:43.620
<i>but someday, without a doubt...</i>

00:24:45.940 --> 00:25:15.340
<b>Next Episode: 
The Division of the Soccer Club</b>

00:24:46.870 --> 00:24:49.790
The FC, who always put 
the fun in soccer first,

00:24:49.790 --> 00:24:52.740
and SC, who always fought against 
the challenges in soccer...

00:24:52.740 --> 00:24:57.010
The rift between the
two teams ran deep,

00:24:57.010 --> 00:25:02.020
and it has begun to influence 
the first year players.

00:25:02.660 --> 00:25:04.460
Can Kakeru's frantic 
preservation efforts

00:25:04.460 --> 00:25:08.240
save the soccer club 
from another split?

00:25:08.690 --> 00:25:10.370
Next time on 
Knight in the Area,

00:25:10.370 --> 00:25:12.780
episode 11: "The Division 
of the Soccer Club."

00:25:13.040 --> 00:25:14.780
What should we do, Seven?!
